# If this top-level directory (the parent of all five projects) is ever
# tracked by git itself - each project already has its own .gitignore for its
# own contents - this keeps the one real secret this level introduces out of
# it: the top-level .env (see .env.example and README.md).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# The scratch tarball used to transfer this whole tree into a build/test
# environment; never meant to be committed or to persist here.
.docker-build-scratch.tar.gz
